Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Stage 1: polish 3D hero and add static fallback

- Hero3D: shader-based key light + rim from per-point normals, intro
  transition, frame-rate-independent pointer damping, subtle camera
  parallax, delta clamping after pauses, context-loss handling, default
  powerPreference (no discrete-GPU wake-up)
- HeroBackdrop: fade-in once the GL context exists; swaps to static
  fallback on no WebGL / context loss / scene error / reduced motion
- HeroFallback: deterministic SVG of the same point cloud + brackets
- useReducedMotion: live prefers-reduced-motion hook
- Fix smoothstep edge order (undefined per GLSL spec when edge0 > edge1)

